{"title":"Ogre Youth","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"q-alert-banner gg-alert\" role=\"note\"><svg class=\"q-alert-ico\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 3 2 21h20z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 10v5M12 17.6v.4\" stroke=\"#1b1300\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/></svg><span>It lives on <b>Ogre Isle</b>, which you can only reach after finishing <a href=\"#/guide/quest-plymouth-the-ogre-traitor\">The Ogre Traitor</a> (Gerald Seabroden).</span></p><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 30 Ogre that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">stab</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/ogre-bone-needle\">Ogre Bone Needle</a> <span class=\"muted\">(rerolls quality)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=29\">Lv 29 <span>28</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=30\">Lv 30 <span>36</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=31\">Lv 31 <span>26</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>48</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>81</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=51\">Lv 51 <span>43</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=52\">Lv 52 <span>110</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=29\" title=\"Pick level 29\"><td><b>29</b></td><td>111</td><td>20.5</td><td>1,450</td><td class=\"muted\">333 · 28.7 · 4,350</td><td>28</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=30\" title=\"Pick level 30\"><td><b>30</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>118</td><td>21</td><td>1,500</td><td class=\"muted\">354 · 29.4 · 4,500</td><td>36</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=31\" title=\"Pick level 31\"><td><b>31</b></td><td>124</td><td>21.6</td><td>1,550</td><td class=\"muted\">372 · 30.2 · 4,650</td><td>26</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=47\" title=\"Pick level 47\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>48</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=48\" title=\"Pick level 48\"><td><b>48</b></td><td>278</td><td>30.9</td><td>2,400</td><td class=\"muted\">834 · 43.3 · 7,200</td><td>81</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>51</b></td><td>316</td><td>32.6</td><td>2,550</td><td class=\"muted\">948 · 45.6 · 7,650</td><td>43</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/ogre-youth?lv=52\" title=\"Pick level 52\"><td><b>52</b></td><td>330</td><td>33.1</td><td>2,600</td><td class=\"muted\">990 · 46.3 · 7,800</td><td>110</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      <h2>Appearance</h2><p class=\"s muted\">How the game draws it. Archers and mages wear better armor as their level goes up.</p><div class=\"look-grid\"><div class=\"look-card\"><img src=\"data/img/e91fb7da8a9f284b6562.webp\" alt=\"\"><div><b>Warrior</b><div class=\"g-note\">Any level</div></div></div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 72 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 82 recorded drops, 2,988 total, 14–120 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×14–120</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 72 of 72 looted corpses, 72 recorded drops, 72 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"health-potion-large\" title=\"Health Potion Large - in 3 of 72 looted corpses, 3 recorded drops, 3 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/752437a6ecea30afa5ec.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Health Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/24<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 2 of 72 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/36<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+10 more\">+10 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 2 of 72 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/36<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 8 total, 8 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×8</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 4 total, 4 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×4</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"tome-weaponsmithing-gold\" title=\"Tome Weaponsmithing Gold - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/49a237011fa1992a466f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Tome Weaponsmithing Gold</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-torso\" title=\"Lizper Torso - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/46936312b236333fa7be.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Torso</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-head\" title=\"Gold Head - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6f6e38fd2ffcc9695a20.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Head</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Good: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"glimmerfox-arms\" title=\"Glimmerfox Arms - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/e3c926e574de75017853.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Glimmerfox Arms</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-longsword\" title=\"Titanium Longsword - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c1a26b20d934bb883929.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Longsword</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Shoddy: 1 of 1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-battlespear\" title=\"Titanium Battlespear - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c4ab2830d321dfc2bed7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Battlespear</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"titanium-fullhelm\" title=\"Titanium Fullhelm - in 1 of 72 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ecb5ddd419cbbf5c9850.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Titanium Fullhelm</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/72<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>The Ogre Longhouse</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 282</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5401\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(-629.7px,-130.1px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/1/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:256px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/2/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:512px;top:0px\"><img src=\"wtiles/2/3/0.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:768px;top:0px\"><i style=\"left:640.9px;top:149.2px\"></i><i style=\"left:614.5px;top:101.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:658.8px;top:145.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:580.0px;top:103.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:621.6px;top:147.9px\"></i><i style=\"left:667.3px;top:140.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:577.6px;top:135.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:653.2px;top:165.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:626.7px;top:139.7px\"></i><i style=\"left:613.3px;top:165.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:638.0px;top:147.3px\"></i><i style=\"left:649.0px;top:116.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:734.4px;top:178.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:617.5px;top:152.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:712.4px;top:161.5px\"></i><i style=\"left:596.7px;top:157.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:613.2px;top:121.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:631.2px;top:106.0px\"></i><i style=\"left:625.5px;top:171.8px\"></i><i style=\"left:612.0px;top:93.4px\"></i><i style=\"left:634.0px;top:82.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:6